# Pull requests

## Title

Same as Conventional Commits: `type(optional-scope): subject`  
(Japanese subject OK; type/scope English.)

## Body

Follow `.github/pull_request_template.md` exactly — same section headings:

1. `## Summary`
2. `## Related`
3. `## Test plan`
4. `## Verification`
5. `## Risk / Rollback`
6. `## Checklist`

- Headings stay in **English**; bullet text may be Japanese.
- Empty optional fields: write `N/A`, do not delete the section.
- When using `gh pr create`, pass a body that matches this template (PowerShell here-string; see `powershell-shell` rule).
- Do not invent alternate section names (`## 概要`, etc.).
